# windOS Zen — tiling extras package list (Debian 13 Trixie)
# Helpers i3status (i3/sway bar), swaybg (Wayland wallpaper) and feh
# (X11 wallpaper for i3/openbox) are required by the skel configs.
# NOTE: bare 'conky', 'neofetch' and 'cpufrequtils' do NOT exist in
# Trixie — do not add them here.
openbox
i3-wm
i3status
sway
swaybg
labwc
foot
rofi
feh
